The controls card names what the pad does.

Two rows of the card `patches/0008` added were wrong against `ball/st_play.c`:

- "Confirm / Look = Cross". Cross starts the level from the ready screen and confirms in
  menus; looking around is F5 with cheats on, which no pad button reaches.
- "Rotate the view = L1 / R1" left out the right stick, which rotates the view too
  (`st_play.c`, the X1 axis).

--- a/ball/st_help.c
+++ b/ball/st_help.c
@@ -219,10 +219,10 @@
             gui_filler(kd);
 
             help_binding(kd, _("Tilt the floor"),   _("Left Stick"));
-            help_binding(kd, _("Rotate the view"),  _("L1 / R1"));
+            help_binding(kd, _("Rotate the view"),  _("Right Stick / L1 / R1"));
             help_binding(kd, _("Rotate faster"),    _("Hold L3"));
             help_binding(kd, _("Change camera"),    _("Square"));
-            help_binding(kd, _("Confirm / Look"),   _("Cross"));
+            help_binding(kd, _("Start / confirm"),  _("Cross"));
             help_binding(kd, _("Back"),             _("Circle"));
             help_binding(kd, _("Pause"),            _("Options"));
 
